    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Flynn Estate Agents have pleasure in presenting 43 Moatfield Avenue to the sales market. A 3 bedroomed, 2 bathroom mid-terraced family home which has been well maintained by its current owners. The property benefits from spacious light filled accommodation which is further enhanced by a cobblelock driveway to front providing off street parking, a large rear garden with access to a gated laneway & is not directly overlooked. Positioned on a mature residential avenue, the convenience of this property cannot be understated, just off of the Tonlegee/Malahide Road`s with access to a choice of buses. Viewing of this home is recommended.\n\nThe house is located just off the Malahide Road on the fringe of Raheny & Killester in this well-established and enviable location. Every conceivable amenity is available on your doorstep choice of schools primary/secondary, choice of bus links, neighbourhood shops, Odeon cinema & numerous shopping centres, The house is less than a 3-minute drive to Raheny Village, Beaumont Hospital and 10 minutes drive to M50/M1 motorways and easily accessible for Dublin International Airport, Dollymount Beach and nearby DART station is a mere 15 minute walk from the house.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance\nPVC double glazed sliding door. Tiled floor.\n\nReception Hall\nPVC double glazed front door & screen.\n\nLounge - 4.22m (13'10\") x 3.69m (12'1\")\nTiled fireplace. Laminate flooring.\n\nDiningroom - 3.63m (11'11\") x 3.61m (11'10\")\nGas fire. Laminate flooring. Sliding patio doors.\n\nKitchen - 3.53m (11'7\") x 2.72m (8'11\")\nRange of oak fitted press units. PVC door to rear.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.56m (11'8\") x 3.55m (11'8\")\nBuilt in wardrobes. Ensuite: shower tray, whb with under sink storage and wc. Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.65m (12'0\") x 2.74m (9'0\")\nSliderobes. Wall panelling.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.88m (9'5\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\n\nShower Room\nElectric shower, whb and wc. Fully tiled floor & walls.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> PVC double glazed windows </li><li> Gas central heating </li><li> Ensuite </li><li> No onward chain </li><li> Cobblelock driveway providing off street parking </li><li> Rear access from gated laneway </li><li> Concrete shed with power </li><li> Sought after address</li></ul>"
      },
